{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 909, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん……", "pointer_offset": 776, "unit": "dialogue:5644766607ea29fd", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 922, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "fb89f0d8f14381482f2ff0a6f0a7f8a8f0a98144", "baseline_text": "왜 그래？//사쿠라 군．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "どうしたんだい？//さくらくん。", "pointer_offset": 780, "unit": "dialogue:b0686ae7f7a5479e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 953, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f174f0aef0b9f1472f2ff0dff0f4f8a3f0d0f0aff0b5f8dbf0a4f0f42f2ff28df0adfdbbf25df157f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "파리에서//제도로 돌아오신 지도//얼마쯤 됐는데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "巴里から、//帝都に帰ってきて、//しばらくたちますけど……", "pointer_offset": 784, "unit": "dialogue:59fedd2b10d39346", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1010, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f38efb8ef174f0aef1442f2ff0d8f0aef1c9f951f28a2f2ff0aff3a0f144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "슬슬 파리가//그리워진 건//아닌가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そろそろ、巴里が//恋しくなったんじゃ//ありませんか？", "pointer_offset": 788, "unit": "dialogue:a2f7a100a0e9fc85", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1063, "capacity": 8, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a4f7d1", "baseline_text": "그렇지…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだな……", "pointer_offset": 792, "unit": "dialogue:58090deaa978807f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1076, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f174f0aef944f0d8f469f0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "파리가 그립네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "巴里がなつかしいな……", "pointer_offset": 796, "unit": "dialogue:70e8245ef70bce98", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1099, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0dff0f4f944fab8f0adf2c3f8b2f3a5f14b8144", "baseline_text": "제도가 더 마음이 편해．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "帝都のほうが落ち着くよ。", "pointer_offset": 800, "unit": "dialogue:6b1cb33ad6f78c77", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1124, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f0f0f944f154f957f3e3f0b2f0a8f1c7f7d1", "baseline_text": "네가 있는 곳이라면…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "キミがいるところなら……", "pointer_offset": 804, "unit": "dialogue:6f477516f4a2f1e0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1149, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f24cf24df0b681432f2ff174f0aef944f0d8f469f0f0f7d1", "baseline_text": "확실히，//파리가 그립네…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "確かに、//巴里がなつかしいな……", "pointer_offset": 808, "unit": "dialogue:4653d033ca61762c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1182, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f2b4f0bc8143f0d8f27ef0a9f0eff7d12f2ff174f8aef2a5f0b28143f1bef0c7f271f0a32f2ff163f1b2f0a5f0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "역시，그렇군요…//파리 쪽이，여러모로//화려하니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "やっぱり、そうですか……//巴里のほうが、何かと//華やかですしね……", "pointer_offset": 812, "unit": "dialogue:b88c29a0cae46ad4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1249, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f7d1f163f1b2f0a5f0cff1c8f0b181432f2ff173f554f0cff1c8f8b1f0a5f957f8f1f0aff0b8f0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "아니…화려하다거나，//귀엽다거나 하는 게 아니라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや……華やかとか、//かわいいとかじゃなくて……", "pointer_offset": 816, "unit": "dialogue:a8c6a7ee48ada11e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1298, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f253f7d12f2ff173f554f0cff957f263f0f32f2ff991f0ccf157f18df0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "저…//귀엽다는 말은//안 했는데요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたし……//かわいいなんて、//言ってないんですけど……", "pointer_offset": 820, "unit": "dialogue:8b1a42cea6d22ab5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1353, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f0a2f2b381ac2f2ff0d88143f0d8f299f0f3f7d1", "baseline_text": "으앗〓//그，그것은…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いいっ〓//そ、それは……", "pointer_offset": 824, "unit": "dialogue:18e5daddb29c0eca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1378, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abfa47f16ff8f3f0a6f17d2f2ff0b2f0df8143f3a7f0a8f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨 같은 사람//이제，몰라요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さんのことなんか//もう、しりません！", "pointer_offset": 828, "unit": "dialogue:1835ea6067515bd4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1419, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f7d12f2ff0dff0f4f944fab8f0adf2c3f8b2f3a5f14b81442f2ff2b4f8bcf1ccf0e3f0d3f0b2f0a8f947f0d8fa62f2e1f2618148", "baseline_text": "아니…//제도가 더 마음이 편해．//역시 일본인이라서 그런 걸까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いや……//帝都のほうが落ち着くよ。//やっぱり日本人だからかな？", "pointer_offset": 832, "unit": "dialogue:7920ae2d8248a971", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1482, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f253f7d12f2ff14ef97bf266f18ef0ccf15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저…//조금 걱정했어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたし……//ちょっと心配してたんです。", "pointer_offset": 836, "unit": "dialogue:c012118b2258dfb8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1521, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff174f0aef8a3f0d0f0aff144f984f2bff0cff1842f2ff0c6f0f7f0a5f24dfa61f349f7d1", "baseline_text": "오오가미 씨…//파리로 돌아가고 싶다고//생각하실까 봐…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "大神さん……//巴里に戻りたいって、//思っちゃうんじゃないかって……", "pointer_offset": 840, "unit": "dialogue:0bc5771b6d6d42e3", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1588, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f0a6f0a7f8a8f0a9f7d1", "baseline_text": "사쿠라 군…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さくらくん……", "pointer_offset": 844, "unit": "dialogue:f64e409aae788fab", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1603, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f1c5f97bf8d8f263f8c8f376f1842f2ff191f36cf0ccf15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "하지만，방금 그 말을 듣고//안심했어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、今の言葉を聞いて//安心しました。", "pointer_offset": 848, "unit": "dialogue:56081077db520839", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0020", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1642, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0d8f27ef0a981442f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0dff0f4f8e7f279f14bf14781432f2ff2c8f960f1bdf1adf0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "…그렇군．//그럼，제도를 위해서，//함께 싸우자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……そうか。//それじゃ、帝都のために、//一緒に戦おう∈", "pointer_offset": 852, "unit": "dialogue:4a8a546bac23c3de", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0021", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2244, "capacity": 12, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解です！", "pointer_offset": 856, "unit": "dialogue:8f8af692652c9e06", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0022", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1708, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0f0f944f154f957f3e3f0b2f0a8f1c7f7d12f2ff0dff0f4f2c08143f174f0aef2c02f2ff15af2e0f0a8f8f4f26af17cf1b5f15a8144", "baseline_text": "네가 있는 곳이라면…//제도든，파리든//어디라도 상관없어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "キミがいるところなら……//帝都でも、巴里でも//どこだってかまわないよ。", "pointer_offset": 860, "unit": "dialogue:46fb2d76f54d2686", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0023", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1779, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b58143f0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f7d12f2ff253f14ff7d1", "baseline_text": "오，오오가미 씨…//저기…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お、大神さん……//あたし……", "pointer_offset": 864, "unit": "dialogue:a9d68eb391a0e07a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0024", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1808, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0fa8143f0a6f0a7f8a8f0a981442f2ff2c8f960f944f285f1438148", "baseline_text": "자，사쿠라 군．//함께 가 줄래？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "さあ、さくらくん。//一緒に来てくれるか！", "pointer_offset": 868, "unit": "dialogue:d2adedaca4c6a709", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0025", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2257, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0f0f7d12f2ff15af2e0f261f0a4f0a8f8f4f2c8f160f0a5f29ef0cef0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "네…//어디까지라도 함께하겠습니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はい……//どこまでもお供します。", "pointer_offset": 872, "unit": "dialogue:d1995090b6cf1e54", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0026", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1882, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef0a4f7d12f2ff174f0aefa9cf0dff0f4f29cf0e72f2ff184f8e7f14af957f1b5f15a8144", "baseline_text": "그렇지…//파리냐 제도냐를//고를 수는 없어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうだな……//巴里か帝都かなんて、//答えられないよ。", "pointer_offset": 876, "unit": "dialogue:fdd9ad99e3d04223", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0027", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1935, "capacity": 6, "raw_hex": "f15af7d18148", "baseline_text": "어…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "え……？", "pointer_offset": 880, "unit": "dialogue:70d75f777e27a8d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0028", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2292, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f271f0f9f9d7f1d4f1ae81432f2ff18ff140f9a9f0f4f0bcf0b8f2618144", "baseline_text": "모두와 만난，//소중한 도시니까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "みんなと出会えた、//大切な街だからね。", "pointer_offset": 884, "unit": "dialogue:dc5fb51c58584693", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0029", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 1983, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f1adf2cef2cef7d1f0d8f2f0f1f3f25281442f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf247f0cff98cf0e2f195f0b2f0a8f7d12f2ff2538143f191f36cf0ccf15af0ef8144", "baseline_text": "우후후…그랬었죠．//오오가미 씨다운 대답이라…//저，안심했어요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うふふ……そうでしたね。//大神さんらしい答えで……//あたし、安心しました。", "pointer_offset": 888, "unit": "dialogue:2f6607e8bc8b1cf0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0030", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2058, "capacity": 50, "raw_hex": "f253f7d12f2ff15af8bdf2a5f0b2f0a8f984f0a5f346f0f4f7d12f2ff2f5f0b4f0ccf8c8fa99f16ff0a2f0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "저…//어느 쪽이라고 하셔도…//곤란했을 것 같으니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あたし……//どっちを言われても……//困っちゃったと思いますから。", "pointer_offset": 892, "unit": "dialogue:2c484557cb869c8d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0031", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2123, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f14ef97bf4dbf0aaf0def0a4f1d481432f2ff99cf39df374f9a9f0adf2c3f0b2f148f7d12f2ff0fa8143f1f7f2d6f8a3f0d0f0aff2ecf2618144", "baseline_text": "조금 쑥스럽지만，//내 솔직한 마음이야…//자，전투로 돌아갈까．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちょっと照れるけど、//俺の正直な気持ちだよ……//さ、戦闘にもどろうか。", "pointer_offset": 896, "unit": "dialogue:32463395eec87ca8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0032", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2194, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f2c9f29ef0cef0b8f0cf81b82f2ff484f19cf947f1bdf1c9f0ef81432f2ff0b5f0b5f144f8abf24781b8", "baseline_text": "알겠습니다∈//힘내서 싸워요，//오오가미 씨∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "了解です！//がんばりましょうね、//大神さん！", "pointer_offset": 900, "unit": "dialogue:214faec7c2940e8f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN#0033", "file": "SLG/G02/E/EV02020.SBN", "offset": 2239, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 904, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
